      "summary": "The Commonwealth Financing Authority, a state agency, approved approximately $1 million in grants for six projects in Pennsylvania's 89th Legislative District. The grants fund infrastructure, fire department equipment, and community facility renovations in Chambersburg, Greene Township, and surrounding Franklin County areas. Rep. Kauffman states he advocated for these grants, though the approval decision was made by the CFA board.",
